abstract: "An interdisciplinary arithmetic research programme with a formal Collatz research supplement. A subsequent automated audit of the published v2.3 sources checked all 137 inventoried theorem declarations across 17 mathematical Lean modules, with no reported sorryAx dependencies. This is not a proof or disproof of the Collatz conjecture or a claim of independent peer review."
keywords:
  - Collatz conjecture
  - number theory
  - Lean 4
  - Mathlib
  - formal verification
  - arithmetic dynamics
  - Diophantine approximation
